# 808Tickets release gate

This project is **808Tickets**.

Launch readiness source of truth: [docs/P0_ACCEPTANCE.md](docs/P0_ACCEPTANCE.md).

## Before coding

1. Run `git status --short`.
2. State which **P0 journey** is affected (organizer, consumer, payment/email/ticket, Wallet/scanner, hosted infra) — or none.

## Definition of complete

Do **not** report complete unless required checks pass.

| Change type | Required validation |
|-------------|---------------------|
| Any code, config, docs, or QA change | `npm run check:all` |
| Launch / P0 work | Also `npm run release:proof -- --prelaunch` unless explicitly told not to |
| UI work | `qa:web` screenshot artifact paths (e.g. `qa/artifacts/screenshots/latest/…`) |
| Hosted / infra work | Include relevant command output |

## Hard constraints

- Never weaken, skip, bypass, or remove checks to pass validation.
- Do **not** run hosted Stripe checkout automatically.
- Do **not** run Stripe smoke automatically unless explicitly asked.
- Do **not** claim hosted checkout readiness without **manual** hosted checkout smoke on `https://808tickets.com`.
- Never suggest `supabase db push` unless direct evidence shows pending migrations or confirmed schema drift.
- If payment checkout behavior changed, explicitly state whether `npm run smoke:payments:local` is required separately (do not run it unless asked).
- Apple Wallet is required for launch.
- If an external manual proof is already complete, preserve that state in docs — do not re-open it as a blocker.

## Customer language

Public/customer copy: **ticket / tickets / mobile ticket / QR ticket** — not “pass”.

Internal `pass` tables, routes, and RPCs may remain unchanged.
